 images"},{"type":"h","text":"Pathology images"},{"type":"h","text":"Disease Surveillance"},{"type":"h","text":"AI can identify patterns in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Animal health records"},{"type":"h","text":"Livestock disease data"},{"type":"h","text":"Epidemiological datasets"},{"type":"h","text":"Population health information"},{"type":"h","text":"Precision Livestock Farming"},{"type":"h","text":"Sensors can monitor:"},{"type":"h","text":"Activity"},{"type":"h","text":"Feeding"},{"type":"h","text":"Temperature"},{"type":"h","text":"Movement"},{"type":"h","text":"Reproductive behaviour"},{"type":"h","text":"Health indicators"},{"type":"h","text":"Important Principle"},{"type":"p","text":"AI should be treated as a decision-support tool, not an autonomous replacement for veterinary clinical judgment."}]},{"heading":"UG Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Companion Animal Disease Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse common diseases in dogs/cats."},{"type":"h","text":"Include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Risk factors"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical presentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Diagnostic approach"},{"type":"h","text":"Prevention"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment principles"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Livestock Health Survey"},{"type":"h","text":"Conduct a supervised survey covering:"},{"type":"h","text":"Disease prevalence"},{"type":"h","text":"Vaccination"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"Housing"},{"type":"h","text":"Biosecurity"},{"type":"h","text":"Farm-management practices"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Veterinary Epidemiology Dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"Build a dashboard showing:"},{"type":"h","text":"Disease cases"},{"type":"h","text":"Species"},{"type":"h","text":"Geographic distribution"},{"type":"h","text":"Age groups"},{"type":"h","text":"Seasonal trends"},{"type":"h","text":"Vaccination status"},{"type":"h","text":"Tools:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"h","text