ness"},{"type":"h","text":"Food safety"},{"type":"h","text":"Epidemiology"},{"type":"h","text":"One Health"},{"type":"h","text":"Disease surveillance"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"h","text":"Client communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Animal welfare"},{"type":"h","text":"Ethical practice"},{"type":"h","text":"Teamwork"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"h","text":"Electronic medical records"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital imaging systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic data analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted research"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BVSc & AH"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Veterinary Surgery"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Diagnostics"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Animal Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Animal Husbandry"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive Medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Veterinary Public Health"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"One Health"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Communication"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Research & Biostatistics"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Veterinary Technology"},{"type":"h","text":"VETERINARY DOCTOR"}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest modern veterinary graduate profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BVSc & AH","Clinical Competence","Diagnostics","Animal Husbandry","Preventive Medicine","One Health","Digital Veterinary Skills","Research"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This keeps the graduate prepared not only for clinical veterinary practice, but also for government veterinary services, livestock industries, veterinary public health, research